All tests pass now. The fix was minimal:

Root cause: Two regression-guard tests require every entry in KNOWN_COMMANDS to appear in the help output. /cd was added to `KNOWN_COMMANDS (as the task required), and help_data.rs` already had its per-command help, but the two listing functions in src/help.rs were missing it:

1. cli_help_text() (backs --help, checked by cli::tests::help_text_documents_all_repl_commands) — added `/cd <path>  Change the working directory (~ and relative paths) next to /context`.
2. help_text() (backs /help, checked by `help::tests::all_help_commands_in_help_text) — added the same line next to /context`.

